#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "The gold digger"
msgstr "Il cercatore d’oro"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instruct your bot to search a zone for subsoil resources."
msgstr "Insegna al robot a cercare risorse nel sottosuolo."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Digger"
msgstr "Digger"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise"
msgstr "Esercizio"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Search the whole zone inside the barriers with the <a object|botsr>sniffer "
"bot</a> for adequate locations for a derrick. When the bot sounds the "
"subsoil and discovers an adequate location for a derrick, it will mark it "
"with a red cross."
msgstr ""
"Esamina l’intera area tra le barriere con il <a object|botsr>robot "
"rilevatore</a>. I siti adatti a una torre di estrazione vengono segnati da "
"croci rosse."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descrizione"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The zone inside the barriers is a square of 25 meters. The most efficient "
"way is to check every 5 meters."
msgstr ""
"L’area è un quadrato di 25 metri di lato. Conviene esaminare il terreno ogni"
" 5 metri."

#. type: Image filename
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "sniff1"
msgstr "sniff1"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"One way to achieve this is to fit two <code><a cbot|for>for</a></code> loops"
" one into another:"
msgstr "Puoi annidare due cicli <code><a cbot|for>for</a></code>:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for ( int y=0 ; y<6 ; y=y+1 )\n"
"{\n"
"\tfor ( int x=0 ; x<5 ; x=x+1 )\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t<n/>sound the subsoil<code>\n"
"\t\t</code>move 5m forward<code>\n"
"\t}\n"
"\t</code>sound the subsoil<code>\n"
"\t</code>quarter turn left<code>\n"
"\t</code>move 5m forward<code>\n"
"\t</code>quarter turn left<c/>\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"for ( int y=0 ; y<6 ; y=y+1 )\n"
"{\n"
"\tfor ( int x=0 ; x<5 ; x=x+1 )\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t<n/>sound the subsoil<code>\n"
"\t\t</code>move 5m forward<code>\n"
"\t}\n"
"\t</code>sound the subsoil<code>\n"
"\t</code>quarter turn left<code>\n"
"\t</code>move 5m forward<code>\n"
"\t</code>quarter turn left<c/>\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This program works well only at the beginning. After the first line, the bot turns correctly left and sounds the second line. But after the second line, it must turn right!\n"
"You will have noticed that if <code>y</code> is even, the bot must turn left, and if <code>y</code> is odd, the bot must turn right.\n"
"The <a cbot|expr>expression</a> <code>y%2</code> returns the rest of the division of <code>y</code> by <code>2</code>. For example, if <code>y=3</code>, the expression returns <code>1</code>.\n"
"The test <code><a cbot|if>if</a> { }</code> can be followed by a <code>else { }</code>. If the test is true, the first <a cbot|bloc>block</a> <code>{ }</code> will be executed. Otherwise, the second block <code>{ }</code> will be executed."
msgstr ""
"Il programma funziona solo all’inizio: dopo la prima fila gira correttamente a sinistra, ma dopo la seconda deve girare a destra!\n"
"Se <code>y</code> è pari deve girare a sinistra, se <code>y</code> è dispari a destra.\n"
"L’<a cbot|expr>espressione</a> <code>y%2</code> restituisce il resto di <code>y</code> diviso <code>2</code>. Con <code>y=3</code> dà <code>1</code>.\n"
"Dopo <code><a cbot|if>if</a> { }</code> puoi aggiungere <code>else { }</code>: se il test è vero esegue il primo <a cbot|bloc>blocco</a> <code>{ }</code>, altrimenti il secondo <code>{ }</code>."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"if ( y%2 == 0 )\n"
"{\n"
"\ty <n/>is even<code>\n"
"}\n"
"else\n"
"{\n"
"\ty </code>is uneven<c/>\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"if ( y%2 == 0 )\n"
"{\n"
"\ty <n/>is even<code>\n"
"}\n"
"else\n"
"{\n"
"\ty </code>is uneven<c/>\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is up to you to finish the program."
msgstr "Completa tu il programma."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remark"
msgstr "Osservazione"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the instruction <code><a cbot|sniff>sniff</a>( )</code> to sound the "
"subsoil, and <code><a cbot|move>move</a>( )</code> and <code><a "
"cbot|turn>turn</a>( )</code> to move the bot."
msgstr ""
"Usa <code><a cbot|sniff>sniff</a>( )</code> per esaminare il sottosuolo, "
"<code><a cbot|move>move</a>( )</code> e <code><a cbot|turn>turn</a>( "
")</code> per muoverti."

